{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-biases","title":"认知偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases","wordCount":1386,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"认知偏差\">认知偏差</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>认知偏差是人类在信息处理和决策过程中系统性偏离理性的思维模式。行为经济学揭示了人们并非传统经济学假设的&quot;完全理性人&quot;，而是依赖启发式（心理捷径）做决策，这些捷径在大多数情况下有效，但在特定场景中会产生可预测的错误。对程序员而言，理解认知偏差有助于设计更好的用户界面、避免项目管理陷阱和做出更理性的技术决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[信息输入] --&gt; B[系统1: 快速直觉]&#10;    A --&gt; C[系统2: 慢速理性]&#10;    B --&gt; D[启发式处理]&#10;    D --&gt; E{认知偏差}&#10;    E --&gt; F[可得性偏差]&#10;    E --&gt; G[锚定效应]&#10;    E --&gt; H[确认偏差]&#10;    E --&gt; I[过度自信]&#10;    C --&gt; J[理性分析]&#10;    J --&gt; K[更准确但耗能]\">graph TD\n    A[信息输入] --&gt; B[系统1: 快速直觉]\n    A --&gt; C[系统2: 慢速理性]\n    B --&gt; D[启发式处理]\n    D --&gt; E{认知偏差}\n    E --&gt; F[可得性偏差]\n    E --&gt; G[锚定效应]\n    E --&gt; H[确认偏差]\n    E --&gt; I[过度自信]\n    C --&gt; J[理性分析]\n    J --&gt; K[更准确但耗能]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>程序员常见表现</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锚定效应</td>\n<td>过度依赖第一个接触的信息</td>\n<td>估时参考上次项目，忽略差异</td>\n<td>使用多种估算方法交叉验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认偏差</td>\n<td>偏好寻找支持己见的证据</td>\n<td>只关注支持技术选型的文章</td>\n<td>主动寻找反面证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可得性偏差</td>\n<td>用容易想到的例子判断概率</td>\n<td>因最近的安全事件过度担忧</td>\n<td>用数据而非印象做决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉没成本谬误</td>\n<td>因已投入而继续亏损项目</td>\n<td>不愿放弃已写的大量代码</td>\n<td>只考虑未来成本和收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度自信</td>\n<td>高估自己的判断准确性</td>\n<td>低估项目复杂度和工期</td>\n<td>记录历史估算偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双系统理论（卡尼曼）将思维分为快系统（直觉、自动、低耗能）和慢系统（分析、刻意、高耗能）。大多数认知偏差源于快系统的过度使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锚定效应与估算偏差\">锚定效应与估算偏差</h2><p>锚定效应是最普遍也最难避免的偏差之一：人们的数值判断会被先接触到的数字（锚点）强烈影响，即使这个数字与问题无关。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EstimationExperiment {&#10;  task: string;&#10;  anchor: number;&#10;  estimates: number[];&#10;  actualValue: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const analyzeAnchoringBias = (&#10;  experiment: EstimationExperiment,&#10;): { meanEstimate: number; anchorEffect: number; accuracy: number } =&gt; {&#10;  const mean = experiment.estimates.reduce((s, v) =&gt; s + v, 0) / experiment.estimates.length;&#10;  const anchorEffect = Math.abs(mean - experiment.actualValue) / experiment.actualValue;&#10;  const accuracy = 1 - anchorEffect;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    meanEstimate: Math.round(mean),&#10;    anchorEffect: Math.round(anchorEffect * 100),&#10;    accuracy: Math.round(accuracy * 100),&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const sprintEstimation: EstimationExperiment = {&#10;  task: &#39;API 重构项目估时&#39;,&#10;  anchor: 2,&#10;  estimates: [3, 2.5, 4, 3, 2],&#10;  actualValue: 8,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const result = analyzeAnchoringBias(sprintEstimation);&#10;console.log(`平均估时: ${result.meanEstimate}周（实际${sprintEstimation.actualValue}周）`);&#10;console.log(`锚定偏差: ${result.anchorEffect}%`);&#10;console.log(`估算准确度: ${result.accuracy}%`);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EstimationExperiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  anchor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  estimates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  actualValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeAnchoringBias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  experiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EstimationExperiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meanEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">anchorEffect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment.estimates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment.estimates.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> anchorEffect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment.actualValue) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment.actualValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anchorEffect;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meanEstimate: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    anchorEffect: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(anchorEffect </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accuracy: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(accuracy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sprintEstimation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EstimationExperiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'API 重构项目估时'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  anchor: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  estimates: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actualValue: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeAnchoringBias</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sprintEstimation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`平均估时: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">meanEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}周（实际${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sprintEstimation</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">actualValue</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}周）`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`锚定偏差: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">anchorEffect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`估算准确度: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在软件工程中锚定效应的典型表现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>锚点来源</th>\n<th>偏差表现</th>\n<th>去锚策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目估时</td>\n<td>&quot;上次类似项目用了2周&quot;</td>\n<td>严重低估新项目复杂度</td>\n<td>使用三点估算法（乐观/最可能/悲观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>薪资谈判</td>\n<td>&quot;你现在薪资多少&quot;</td>\n<td>被现有薪资锚定</td>\n<td>先研究市场价，设置己方锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术方案评审</td>\n<td>第一个被提出的方案</td>\n<td>后续方案被拿来与第一个比较</td>\n<td>独立评估每个方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能目标</td>\n<td>竞品当前性能</td>\n<td>以竞品为参照而非用户需求</td>\n<td>从用户场景出发设定目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"确认偏差与技术决策\">确认偏差与技术决策</h2><p>确认偏差导致人们选择性地寻找、解读和记忆支持自己已有观点的信息。在技术决策中，这可能导致固守错误的技术路线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[初始观点: React最好] --&gt; B[搜索信息]&#10;    B --&gt; C[React优势文章 ✓ 接受]&#10;    B --&gt; D[React劣势文章 ✗ 忽略]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Vue优势文章 ✗ 反驳]&#10;    C --&gt; F[强化初始观点]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[确认偏差循环]\">graph LR\n    A[初始观点: React最好] --&gt; B[搜索信息]\n    B --&gt; C[React优势文章 ✓ 接受]\n    B --&gt; D[React劣势文章 ✗ 忽略]\n    B --&gt; E[Vue优势文章 ✗ 反驳]\n    C --&gt; F[强化初始观点]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[确认偏差循环]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TechEvaluation {&#10;  technology: string;&#10;  pros: string[];&#10;  cons: string[];&#10;  confirmedBias: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const debiasedEvaluation = (&#10;  techs: TechEvaluation[],&#10;): Array&